The live site https://nyc-urban-mobility.vercel.app is frozen.

- New work ships as a pull request preview only.
- Do not run `vercel --prod`, `vercel deploy --prod`, or `vercel promote`.
- Do not push, merge, or delete `archive/poc`. It is the Vercel production branch and it is locked.
- Do not change the Vercel production branch or the production domain.
